; The JavaScript routes as engines for the comparison coordinator, run out of
; process: node runs a helper (js/jsoo/compare_js_engine) that holds the
; generated-JavaScript executors and the js_of_ocaml build of the Native
; evaluator, which only exist under js_of_ocaml. The driver speaks the wire
; protocol of inference_compare_js_wire over the helper's stdin and stdout.
; Registered with the variant vocabulary by [register]; a missing node or helper
; is a refusal naming it, never another engine.

(library
 (name inference_compare_js)
 (libraries
  err_trace
  fmt
  inference_compare_js_wire
  inference_compare_pt2
  inference_compare_schema
  jsont
  jsont.bytesrw
  loop_c_exec
  loop_wasm_exec
  native
  unix))
